### 1. Create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "nameUz": "O'zbekiston",
  "nameRu": "Узбекистан",
  "nameEn": "Uzbekistan",
  "key": "uzbekistan",
  "visible": true
}

### 2. Get all
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories?page=0&size=20

### 3. Get by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories/1

### 4. Get by language
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories/lang
Accept-Language: uz

### 5. Update
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "nameUz": "O'zbekiston",
  "nameRu": "Узбекистан",
  "nameEn": "Uzbekistan",
  "key": "uzbekistan",
  "visible": true
}

### 6. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/v1/categories/1